<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Allen Telecom started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Allen Telecom started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>NatWest Securities said Tuesday it started coverage of Allen Telecom Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1/16 to 26.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
